# PR and Commit Rules for AI Agents

Canonical source: `.github/agents/pr-and-commit-rules.md`. The mechanical commit
and git rules are handled by tooling; only the rules you must apply yourself are
listed here.

## Pull Request Rules

- **NEVER fill in the PR template.** Create the PR with
  `.github/PULL_REQUEST_TEMPLATE.md` as the body, unmodified. See the canonical
  source for the details and the one exception.
